    "expression_latex": "{2\\maxgap K(\\alpha - 1) \\over \\alpha - 2} + \\sum_{i \\in A'} {8\\alpha\\sigma^2 \\log n \\over \\gap{i}} + \\sum_i \\gap{i}",
